    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in an unknown but familiar facility. Can you find out how you got there and get out?<br><br>Echo Protocol is an escape room that will test your skills. Solve puzzles, decode secret codes and investigate the different rooms of this acilities. Help Hamilton\u00a0find out what is going on.<br><br>Solve this mystery by exploring the rooms of this sci fi facilities. Will you manage to escape?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles based on logic, observation and pattern identification.<br>Explore different rooms to find clues.<br>Discover how and why you are there.<br>Enjoy the mysterious and atmospheric environment we have created for you.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in an unknown but familiar facility. Can you find out how you got there and get out?<br><br>Echo Protocol is an escape room that will test your skills. Solve puzzles, decode secret codes and investigate the different rooms of this acilities. Help Hamilton\u00a0find out what is going on.<br><br>Solve this mystery by exploring the rooms of this sci fi facilities. Will you manage to escape?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles based on logic, observation and pattern identification.<br>Explore different rooms to find clues.<br>Discover how and why you are there.<br>Enjoy the mysterious and atmospheric environment we have created for you.</p>",
